Subject: Select checked original interpreter execution for native bytecode

Upstream-base: f1e9646a7da6950143e77b1daed33a92c931a638

Extract the original execution methods, retaining their instruction dispatch,
control flow and numeric equations. Native owner hooks validate each access and
keep string/frame/code references separate from 32-bit numeric values. Numeric
globals are selected; tweak registration and original pointer relocation remain
unselected. Original operation bodies retain arithmetic and case-insensitive
string comparisons, resolving checked native strings through an explicit hook.
Console InterpreterCore and string pointer behavior remain unchanged.

